OL,3,GNEWSANew chief minister pledges to
OL,4,Adeliver 'mandate for change'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Thomas, the Isle of Man's new
OL,7,Fchief minister, said he is "honoured"
OL,8,Fto be appointed, pledging to use his
OL,9,Flong experience as a member of the
OL,10,FHouse to Keys to deliver change for
OL,11,FManx residents.
OL,13,FThe Douglas Central MHK defeated
OL,14,Fnewcomer Kirrie Jenkins in Tuesday's
OL,15,Fvote, describing his victory as "very
OL,16,Femotional".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
