OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew chief minister pledges to
OL,4,Adeliver 'mandate for change'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Thomas insisted the
OL,7,Fappointment was not about him
OL,8,Fpersonally, and stressed his priority
OL,9,Fwas to deliver on the "mandate for
OL,10,Fchange" advanced in September's general
OL,11,Felection, in which 15 of the 24 MHKs
OL,12,Fvoted in were newcomers.
OL,14,FHe said: "I build teams well, and
OL,15,Fencourage learning and encourage
OL,16,Fteamwork. That's the way we'll go
OL,17,Fforward."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
